<title>ISRAEL: Up to seven Israeli schoolgirls feared killed.</title>
<headline>Up to seven Israeli schoolgirls feared killed.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel Radio said up to seven Israeli schoolgirls were feared killed on Thursday by a Jordanian soldier who fired on them at the Israeli-Jordanian border.</p>
<p>Israel said earlier that two schoolgirls were killed but the radio said as many as five dead were at a hospital in Jordan. It said the foreign ministry was in contact with Jordanian officials.</p>
